      "spans": [
        { "text": "One reminder, since the shorthand carries the rest of this chapter: " },
        { "text": "5·3", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": " means string 5, fret 3 — string 1 is the high " },
        { "text": "e", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ", string 6 the low " },
        { "text": "E", "marks": ["code"] },
        { "text": ". The C form's window is frets " },
        { "text": "9–13", "marks": ["code"] },
        {
          "text": ", the highest of the five and the least friendly to a whole hand — chapter 2 said as much, and this is the same window, filled all the way in. Seventeen dots now sit inside it."
        }
